OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy with a few outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fbut clearer intervals developing in
OL,8,Fthe evening. Overnight there may be a
OL,9,Ffew showers, with clear intervals
OL,10,Fbetween them.Winds easing. Rather cold.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FVariable cloud with some
OL,13,Fbright or sunny spells. A few showers
OL,14,Fpossible, these mainly in the west
OL,15,Fwhere they may be heavy, with longer
OL,16,Fdry spells in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
